  "description": "A .NET Standard 2.0 library for Task Parallel Library (TPL) orchestration with Dependency Injection support. Tasks are identified by string key and managed through a status-based API — register, start, cancel, check completion, and delete — without exposing raw Task objects to callers. Includes an append-only observability queue that captures disposal metadata for external monitoring.",
